        "ST-44",
        "ST-45"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "U-05",
      "question": "At what precision is the 2-hour cancellation deadline compared (hours, minutes, seconds)? How is a cancel 1 h 59 min or 2 h 0 min 1 s before window_start handled?",
      "affects": [
        "BV-01"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "U-06",
      "question": "Is a cancel at or after window_start (the window has already started or ended) \"closer than\" 2 hours and so refused with 409, or is it handled differently?",
      "affects": [
        "EP-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "U-07",
      "question": "Cancel is \"Operator-initiated\". What happens when a reviewer, or an operator who doesn't own the request, tries to cancel? The text gives no rule or response.",
      "affects": [
        "ST-07",
        "ST-14",
        "ST-21",
        "ST-28"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "U-08",
      "question": "When submit fails because of an overlap, which failing_gate is reported? Line 66 puts the overlap check \"inside the `AIRCRAFT` / `TIME_WINDOW` gates\", which doesn't say which one.",
      "affects": [
        "EP-14",
        "EP-16"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "U-09",
